    {
      "id": "nrEh-0ZVGToAIjaIl8fiC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15367.461595833016,
      "y": 5638.056148660388,
      "width": 1349.274900005116,
      "height": 224.13202405935834,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1298077734,
      "version": 458,
      "versionNonce": 873636134,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794638742304,
      "created": 1794571296724,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-- Live: location + its BU + its sub-merchant, one hop at a time. so that we can check weather location is enabled at all for payment\nSELECT BIN_TO_UUID(l.id), l.enabled, l.enable_requested,\n       BIN_TO_UUID(l.business_unit_id),\n       BIN_TO_UUID(bu.sub_merchant_id)\nFROM payfac_submerchant.location l\nJOIN payfac_submerchant.business_unit bu ON bu.id = l.business_unit_id\nWHERE l.id = UUID_TO_BIN('<location-uuid>');\n",
      "fontSize": 22.413202405935834,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-- Live: location + its BU + its sub-merchant, one hop at a time. so that we can check weather location is enabled at all for payment\nSELECT BIN_TO_UUID(l.id), l.enabled, l.enable_requested,\n       BIN_TO_UUID(l.business_unit_id),\n       BIN_TO_UUID(bu.sub_merchant_id)\nFROM payfac_submerchant.location l\nJOIN payfac_submerchant.business_unit bu ON bu.id = l.business_unit_id\nWHERE l.id = UUID_TO_BIN('<location-uuid>');\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xBPRUjcSBtx7yI3wI1ASx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16192.997261722927,
      "y": 6030.726792133759,
      "width": 1193.9045840901392,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 926941926,
      "version": 476,
      "versionNonce": 1487899750,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794638742304,
      "created": 1794571354550,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Storage: location.id, business_unit_id, etc. are stored as BINARY(16) (raw bytes) in the table — not as a readable string.\n2. What you see in Datadog/logs: the human-readable UUID string format (e.g. 15c04891-9765-4f17-a16c-aaf143c2db88).\n3. Going IN (WHERE clause): you must convert that string → binary using UUID_TO_BIN('...'), because MySQL can't compare a string\ndirectly against a BINARY(16) column.\n4. Coming OUT (SELECT clause): the raw binary would print as unreadable garbage, so you convert it back → string using\nBIN_TO_UUID(column).\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Storage: location.id, business_unit_id, etc. are stored as BINARY(16) (raw bytes) in the table — not as a readable string.\n2. What you see in Datadog/logs: the human-readable UUID string format (e.g. 15c04891-9765-4f17-a16c-aaf143c2db88).\n3. Going IN (WHERE clause): you must convert that string → binary using UUID_TO_BIN('...'), because MySQL can't compare a string directly against a BINARY(16) column.\n4. Coming OUT (SELECT clause): the raw binary would print as unreadable garbage, so you convert it back → string using BIN_TO_UUID(column).\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "II_ygFakoHZR3UPTx2TII",
      "type": "text",
