      "text": "vi   new-file.txt\nopens a file if exists or else creates file if doesnt\n\nEsc - default mode allows to type quit or save commands\n\ni - press i throws u into insert mode and add text\n     and press Esc\n\n:w - to save file\n\n:q - to quit \n\n:wq  -to save file and quit vi editor \n\n:q! - to force quit without saving anything\n\nshift + V - enters into visual line mean it selects entire current line so we can delete it\nsimply",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vi   new-file.txt\nopens a file if exists or else creates file if doesnt\n\nEsc - default mode allows to type quit or save commands\n\ni - press i throws u into insert mode and add text\n     and press Esc\n\n:w - to save file\n\n:q - to quit \n\n:wq  -to save file and quit vi editor \n\n:q! - to force quit without saving anything\n\nshift + V - enters into visual line mean it selects entire current line so we can delete it simply",
